{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24812","headline":"和周侍郎见寄 · 王起","name":"和周侍郎见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贡院离来二十霜，谁知更忝主文场。\n杨叶纵能穿旧的，桂枝何必爱新香。\n九重每忆同仙禁，六义初吟得夜光。\n莫道相知不相见，莲峰之下欲徵黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}